# Dashboard Widgets

Authoritative list of all **16** widget types available on dashboards.

- **Widget union:** `apps/web/rpc/contract.ts` (lines ~696–713)
- **Renderers:** `apps/web/src/components/dashboard/WidgetCanvas.tsx`
- **Factory:** `apps/web/src/lib/dashboards.ts` (`newWidget`)

## Summary

| # | Type | conceptId | Scope | One-liner |
|---|------|-----------|-------|-----------|
| 1 | `metric` | Yes | Concept | Single aggregated number (count/sum/avg) + delta |
| 2 | `list` | Yes | Concept | Filtered instances as table or cards |
| 3 | `breakdown` | Yes | Concept | Group instances by field → bar/pie chart |
| 4 | `attention` | Yes (opt) | Concept | Decay/momentum band rollup + stale queue |
| 5 | `trend` | Optional | Org/Concept | Event count time-series over 7/30/90d |
| 6 | `activity` | Optional | Org/Concept | Recent events as timeline or log feed |
| 7 | `tasks` | No* | Org | Global task list, grouped/filterable |
| 8 | `members` | No | Org | Member directory (rows/grid) |
| 9 | `welcome` | No | Org | Greeting banner + pulse + quick links |
| 10 | `goal` | Yes | Concept | Metric vs manual target (bar/ring/number) |
| 11 | `shortcuts` | No | Static | Hand-picked jump-off links |
| 12 | `note` | No | Static | Free-form rich-text on the canvas |
| 13 | `kanban` | Yes | Concept | Enum-grouped card board, drag-to-update |
| 14 | `calendar` | No | Multi-concept | Instances by date field (month/week/agenda) |
| 15 | `gantt` | Yes | Concept | Bars between two date fields, swimlanes |
| 16 | `files` | Yes (opt) | Instance/Concept/Org | Attachment browser + upload |

\* `tasks` is org-global but accepts an optional concept filter.

---

## Data-bound widgets (require a concept)

### 1. `metric` — Hero Number
Single aggregated number with optional change delta.
Config: `conditions`, `agg` (count/sum/avg), `field`, `label`, `variant` (auto/tile/bar), `format` (plain/compact/currency/percent), `delta` (off/7d/30d), `includeArchived`.

### 2. `list` — List / Table
Instances matching filters, as a table (columns) or cards on narrow tiles.
Config: `conditions`, `orderBy`, `limit`, `columns`, `variant` (auto/table/cards), `archived` (exclude/include/only).

### 3. `breakdown` — Grouping Chart
Groups instances by an enum field (or labels) into a bar/pie chart.
Config: `conditions`, `groupBy` (field id or `__labels`), `chart` (bar/pie), `sort` (count/label/field), `values` (count/percent/both), `maxGroups`.

### 4. `attention` — Band Rollup
Decay/momentum computed-field bands (cooling/cold/heating/steady) + stale-queue list.
Config: `computedField`, `bands[]`, `limit`, `variant` (bands/strip), `showDays`, `conditions`.

### 10. `goal` — Progress Tracker
Metric with a manual target finish line.
Config: `conditions`, `agg`, `field`, `target`, `direction` (reach=quota / stay=budget), `variant` (bar/ring/number), `showPercent`.

### 13. `kanban` — Board
Instances as cards in columns keyed by an enum field.
Config: `conditions`, `groupBy` (enum field), `cardFields[]`, `dragToUpdate`, `columns` (subset/order), `showEmptyColumns`, `orderBy`, `includeArchived`.

### 15. `gantt` — Timeline
Instances as bars between two date fields with optional swimlanes.
Config: `conditions`, `scale` (day/week/month), `startField`, `endField` (absent = milestone), `groupBy` (swimlanes), `barLabelField`, `progressField` (0–100), `showTodayLine`, `window` (fit/90d/quarter).

