## Optional-concept / multi-concept widgets

### 5. `trend` — Time Series
Event count bucketed by day/week. Org-wide if no concept.
Config: `eventTypes[]`, `bucket` (day/week), `since` (7d/30d/90d), `chart` (area/bars), `showDelta`.

### 6. `activity` — Activity Feed
Recent events (updates, notes, tasks) as a timeline rail or dense log.
Config: `limit`, `variant` (auto/timeline/log), `showDiffs`, `eventTypes[]`.

### 14. `calendar` — Calendar
Multi-concept overlay; instances plotted by a date field. Scoped via `sources`.
Config: `mode` (month/week/agenda), `sources[]` (conceptId, dateField, +color/labelField/conditions), `includeTasks`, `density` (full/dots).

### 16. `files` — Attachment Browser
Uploads attached to instances, browsed at a chosen scope.
Config: `scope` (instance/concept/org), `instanceId` (for instance scope), `allowUpload`, `variant` (gallery/list), `sort` (newest/name/size), `limit`, `fileType` (all/image/doc/pdf/other).

