## Page widgets (no concept — org/static)

### 7. `tasks` — Tasks
Org-global task list with toolbar, composer, grouping.
Config: `assignee` (all/me/none), `showToolbar`, `showComposer`, `showDone`, `variant` (full/checklist), `groupBy` (schedule/status/priority/none), `rowMeta[]` (due/priority/labels/assignee), `statusIds[]`, `due` (any/overdue/week), `conceptId` (optional filter).

### 8. `members` — Directory
Org member directory.
Config: `showToolbar`, `variant` (rows/grid), `fields[]` (role/email/joined), `sort` (name/role/joined), `limit`.

### 9. `welcome` — Welcome
Big-title greeting banner with optional pulse line + quick links.
Config: `variant` (hero/card), `showPulse`, `links[]` (ShortcutItem).

### 11. `shortcuts` — Shortcuts
Hand-picked jump-off points (manual, no filters).
Config: `items[]` (kind = instance/dashboard/url, ref, label, icon), `variant` (list/grid), `newTab`.

### 12. `note` — Note
Free-form rich-text (ProseMirror JSON envelope).
Config: `content` ({doc, text}), `appearance` (plain/info/warn/success), `overflow` (clip/scroll).
